    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d284">

                <pb facs="0281" n="271" sameAs="frus:frus1944v04/pg271"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 Control (Rumania)/11–3044:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Representative in Rumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Berry</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-11-30T11:00:00+02:00">November 30,
                            1944—11 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 4:20 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>41. General Vinogradov in conversation with Air Vice Marshal Stevenson yesterday
                    afternoon hinted that Marshal Malinovsky who personally commands the second
                    Ukrainian army before Budapest and is at the same time President of the Allied
                    Control Commission is now here secretly, probably for consultation with
                    Vishinsky.</p>
                <p>As the ACC has never formally been constituted, I have suggested to General
                    Schuyler this might be the time to press for its formal constitution.</p>
                <p>At present the Soviet Command issues instructions to the Rumanian authorities in
                    the name of the ACC. Thus we share in the responsibility for these instructions
                    but we have not shared in the drafting of them.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Berry</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
